    "title": "kill - Close a foreground app",
    "synopsis": "kill <app-id>",
    "description": "Asks the shell to close an app window, freeing its RAM. Named by id (the one ps prints), not by the synthetic PID.",
    "details": "NAME\n  kill - Close a foreground app\n\nSYNOPSIS\n  kill <app-id>\n\nDESCRIPTION\n  Asks the shell to close an app window, freeing its RAM. Named by id (the one ps prints), not by the synthetic PID.\n\nOPTIONS\n  No options.\n\nDEVICE COST\n  none — a message to the shell\n\nSEE ALSO\n  ps(1), apps(1)\n\nEXAMPLES\n  ps\n  kill notes"
